Subject: [PATCH] input: a rebindable keyboard and mouse layout

The layout of 0009 as data: for each pad button and stick direction a list of keys or mouse
buttons, PS2X_KEYMAP at start, ps2_host_input::setKeyBindings while running (the game's
controls menu), keyBindings / defaultKeyBindings / keyName / keyCode for it.

